WEBVTT

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:33.112
Jennifer Aaker: Turns out that humor
is a teachable skill,

00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:36.699
and one of the most
underappreciated assets at work.

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:38.326
For the record,

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:41.662
our class on humor
gets the same academic credit

00:00:41.704 --> 00:00:43.623
as financial accounting,

00:00:43.664 --> 00:00:45.041
NB: ... which is not a joke.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:46.793
JA: Here is the problem, though.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.670
We've all fallen off a humor cliff.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.130
In a global study,

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.008
over a million people
were asked a simple question:

00:00:54.008 --> 00:00:57.011
"Did you smile or laugh a lot, yesterday?"

00:00:57.011 --> 00:00:59.472
When we are kids, the answer is "yes."

00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:02.183
Then, right when we enter the workforce,